@startuml
title Session Flow Refinements - Sequence View
actor Teacher
actor Student
participant "Activity Session" as Activity
participant "Presence Detector" as Presence
participant "Team" as Team
participant "Session Service" as Sessions
participant "Revisioned WebSocket Publishers" as Publishers
participant "Teacher and Student Views" as Views
Teacher -> Activity : create activity
Activity --> Teacher : both visible; join enabled; answer disabled
Teacher -> Activity : start joining
Activity --> Teacher : both visible; join disabled; answer enabled
loop while team formation is active
  Presence -> Presence : check participant heartbeat
  alt leader heartbeat reaches 30 seconds without response
    Presence -> Team : begin transaction; mark leader offline
    Team -> Team : promote remaining online member or clear leader
    Team -> Team : increment group and activity revisions once
    Presence -> Publishers : commit, then publish snapshots
    Publishers -> Views : roster leaderOnline and team groupRole
  else student uses return action
    Student -> Sessions : POST reset-context
    Sessions -> Team : begin transaction; promote or clear leader
    Sessions -> Sessions : detach and retire departing session
    Sessions -> Team : increment group and activity revisions once
    Sessions -> Publishers : commit, then publish snapshots
    Publishers -> Views : roster and remaining member role
  end
end
Teacher -> Activity : start answering
Activity --> Teacher : both visible and disabled
note over Team
  At most two online seats.
  A first joiner to an empty team without a leader becomes leader.
  Outside preparation, do not promote on departure.
end note
@enduml
